# with a characters.csv OverchargedUltimateSkill have it as their third skill instance (char+0x458[2]); while hypercharged
# instances 1 and 2 are swapped so the game's super code casts it, and swapped back once the hypercharge ended and that super
# is idle (hyper_unswap, from env.c hyper_tick). Meg's mech (MechaDudeBig) takes Meg's card (hyper_card_for). NbeResp
# hyp_supers / hyp_super_id count the supers cast while hypercharged, mirrored in py/nbpc/proto.py. Applies on top of
